Package: blockr.outline
Title: Board Outline, Code and Report Extension for 'blockr'
Version: 0.0.90
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Christoph",
             family = "Sax",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "christoph@cynkra.com"))
Description: A dock extension that renders a blockr board as a linked
    outline: block chips aligned with generated code sections, per-block
    markdown descriptions and report inclusion stored as extension state,
    a user-sortable block order (applied as the tie-break of the
    topological sort), and rendering of the inverted document to html,
    pptx or pdf via quarto with an rmarkdown fallback. Uses only exported
    blockr.core and blockr.dock API; no forks required.
URL: https://github.com/cynkra/blockr.outline
BugReports: https://github.com/cynkra/blockr.outline/issues
